  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Reads the Matched AePS xlsx, aggregates STP totals per BC agent float pool, verifies zero delta between&#xd;&#xa;NPCI settlement amount and GL-9904 suspense, then POSTs one balanced DR/CR knock-off journal (with per-BC breakdown and a&#xd;&#xa;SHA-256 evidence hash) to NPCI_URL. Idempotency-Key header = run id, so a replay cannot double-post.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Runtime params: Matched_File_Path, NPCI_URL (default http://localhost:8000/api/recon/run). Config: OUTPUT_DIR.&#xd;&#xa;Success message: &#x22;AePS Zero-Delta GL Knock-off Posted - Settlement Closed&#x22;.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Errors: file / URL validated up front; non-STP rows or non-zero delta block posting (Failure); empty file = Diverted;&#xd;&#xa;API connection errors go down the error hop (Failure, CONNECTION_FAILURE); non-2xx = Failure. Every outcome is written to&#xd;&#xa;AePS_GL_Knockoff_Audit_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx. Unreadable xlsx rows are quarantined in OUTPUT_DIR/rejects.</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
      <yloc>560</yloc>
      <width>900</width>
      <heigth>300</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>192</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>192</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>192</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
      <shadow_size>5</shadow_size>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
</transformation>
